# 0p_temple_hall: GunTurret bases u0465/u0437, tops u046a/u0439. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 3bfa3eff,0p_temple_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u046a 15 300
@f330 scan u0465 15 300
@f600 fsm u0465 IntoPan
@f700 fsm u0465 PanLeft
@f800 fsm u0465 PanRight
@f900 fsm u0465 AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u0465 Flinch
@f1100 fsm u0465 CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u0465 OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u0465 Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u046a PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u046a PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u0465 Attack
@f1600 damage u046a 5
@f1700 damage u046a 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u0437 Patrol
@f1900 statecall u0437 IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u0437 IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u0437 IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u0437 AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u0437 AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u0437 AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u0437 Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u0437 Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u0437 Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u046a
@f2200 obj u0465; obj u046a
@f2300 tp 2 330 -44
@f2900 obj u0465; obj u0437
@f3000 kill u0439
@f3300 objs GunTurret
